* diff-receiver-sensitivity -- body for `klt pex` (issue #485): the committed bench fragment, with the harness preamble (nominal supply .param cards) inlined and a single DUT .include.
* The PDK's design.ngspice globals are supplied by the request's models.param_file, not a second .include.
.param vdd_nom=3.3
.param vdd_val=3.3
.param temp_c=27.0
.include "differential_receiver_pex_order.spice"
vsup VDD 0 dc {vdd_val}
vsw  sw  0 dc 0
bmid mid 0 v = 0.5*v(vdd)
bn1  n1  0 v = v(rxd1)/v(vdd)
bn2  n2  0 v = v(rxd2)/v(vdd)
bn3  n3  0 v = v(rxd3)/v(vdd)
vcm1 CM1 0 dc 0.8
edp1 DP1 CM1 sw 0  0.5
edm1 DM1 CM1 sw 0 -0.5
Xrx1 DM1 DP1 RXD1 VDD 0 differential_receiver
vcm2 CM2 0 dc 1.65
edp2 DP2 CM2 sw 0  0.5
edm2 DM2 CM2 sw 0 -0.5
Xrx2 DM2 DP2 RXD2 VDD 0 differential_receiver
vcm3 CM3 0 dc 2.5
edp3 DP3 CM3 sw 0  0.5
edm3 DM3 CM3 sw 0 -0.5
Xrx3 DM3 DP3 RXD3 VDD 0 differential_receiver
